tion-list\"></div><section class=\"verify\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">VERIFY IN CHATGPT</span><h3>Prove the connection works</h3><p id=\"check\"></p><button id=\"copy\" class=\"secondary\">Copy verification prompt</button><p class=\"hint\">A valid ID means configuration is ready. Only a successful tool call establishes a working connection.</p></section></section></div><section class=\"bottom grid\"><div><h2>Save your setup</h2><p>Save an encrypted file containing addresses, app IDs and any keys you entered. Your passphrase is required to reopen it.</p><label for=\"passphrase\">Backup passphrase</label><input id=\"passphrase\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"At least 14 characters\"><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"backup\">Download encrypted backup</button><label class=\"button secondary\" for=\"restore\">Restore backup</label><input id=\"restore\" type=\"file\" accept=\".json\" hidden></div><button id=\"clear\" class=\"quiet\">Clear this session</button><p id=\"backup-message\" role=\"status\"></p></div><div><h2>Install the update</h2><ol><li>Download a configured plugin after attaching its services.</li><li>Give the ZIP to Plugin Creator and ask it to update the existing GMRI plugin. It must preserve your plugin identity and audience.</li><li>For Cloud Access, replace the old bundled Porkbun definition with the registered connection. The update must explicitly delete the previous <code>mcp.json</code>; simply omitting it does not remove it.</li><li>Start a new chat and run the copied read-only verification prompt.</li></ol><p class=\"hint\">This desk generates packages. It cannot publish installed-plugin updates or finish provider sign-in for you.</p><a href=\"guide.md\" download>Download complete setup directions</a> · <a href=\"evaluation.md\" download>Read evaluation results</a></div></section></main><footer>GMRI · Configuration is not verification.</footer><script type=\"module\" src=\"app.mjs\"></script></body></html>
